  << /ActualText (Stamp categories\072 social media\054 blockchain\054 government to cover most needs and use cases\056\052 Categorized so that we do not overwhelm the user after initially having them all lumped together\056\n\nTransparency\072 Rather than hiding expiration dates inside details\054 every stamp visibly communicates one of three states\072 Verified\054 Expired or Needs Update\056\n\nIA\072 Sidebar UI for stamp details\054 providing users with clear data on cost\054 time requirements\054 and points breakdown\056)
